            <ArticleTitle>Chronic and recurrent headaches in children and adolescents.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1027-51</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Headache is a common chronic and recurrent symptom in children and adolescents. The author discusses the prevalence of headache, its differential diagnosis, interpretation of symptoms, methods of assessment, and pharmacologic and nonpharmacologic treatment approaches.</AbstractText>
